LUMA SUMMARY:
Source-inspection session for MMRC Luma 1.7. Cozmo identifies this as a fresh archive of the currently running candidate; the team inspects the source and distinguishes actual requirements from habits. They establish that Opera is not inherently required—the dependency is Chromium/CDP on port 9222—and that the candidate should be investigated rather than modified blindly. Cozmo also discovers that pasting full source through the relay is the wrong transport and can break MMRC/Opera.
